WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.440
<b>Sold Out</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.390
Completion.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.360
Farewell.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.370
Hello!

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.550
Report.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:22.780
I won.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.150
I'd like you to book my next opponent now.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.720
You're quite greedy, Hanna-chan.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.220
But what is this all about?

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.300
Unexpected.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.260
A minor accident occurred.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.620
You can't see the depths of the darkness.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.640
If you step into it, you'll just be swallowed up.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.440
<b>WIXOSS  Darkness  Truth</b>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.860
<b>The Darkness of WIXOSS</b>

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.070
<b>Was it Mayu?</b>

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.510
Mayu...

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.000
Truth / Ending and Beginning

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.920
The truth about the Selector battles?

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.750
Confusion. The more research I do,

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.750
the more shady rumors and 
urban legends I encounter.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:42.390
But as I followed what little light there was,

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.660
I discovered a certain name.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:46.850
A name?

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.070
Morikawa!

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:52.150
Shirai-kun.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.230
Morikawa...

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.860
I'm in a hurry.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.200
Are you going to see Satomi?

00:02:59.200 --> 00:02:59.950
And if I am?

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.340
Don't go!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.200
Stay away from that guy.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.110
Let me go.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:14.970
Morikawa...

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:16.880
Here.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.800
Oh, Shirai Shouhei-kun?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.430
Huh?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.310
<b>June 17</b>

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.310
This is dated yesterday...

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:28.920
I forgot it.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.500
Put it away.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.560
Okay.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:37.980
Do you have some kind of special 
relationship with Shirai-kun?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.570
Of course not.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.530
Hello.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.790
You're a Selector, right?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.320
Have you ever heard of the bookmaker?

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.950
That's a bad idea.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.040
You...

00:03:58.950 --> 00:03:59.960
What?

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.040
It's nothing.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.030
Go.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.100
What are you thinking?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.860
You're just being used.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.140
Do you understand that?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.840
I don't need your help!

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.340
I see.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:16.980
You know, and you're still doing it.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.200
Why?

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.230
It's not your problem.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.240
What you said was right.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.120
Aren't you the one tying yourself down?

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.920
I decided to stop tying myself 
down, and to live freely.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:39.960
Really?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.590
It doesn't look like it.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.720
Want to try me?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.470
Very well.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:46.860
Open.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.020
She only needs one more win?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.320
Piruluk, grow.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.080
And summon Shouryuu, then turn end.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.780
Meru, grow.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.740
Summon Muffin and Meishiro.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.120
Full attack.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.620
Meru, attack!

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:19.750
Guard.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:23.580
Turn end.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.700
You won't use your coin, Chi-chan?

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.260
It's better not to have a plan.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.690
Her ability lets her know what I'm going to do.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.300
Piruluk, grow.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:37.020
Turn end.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.770
She's not attacking?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.200
Or using her coin.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.860
What is she thinking?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:45.940
Meru, grow.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.290
Place SIGNI and do a full attack.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.940
She's not even defending?

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.740
Morikawa Chinatsu-san.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:11.510
I'll tell you about this twisted world,

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.640
and what the Selector battles are.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.740
What the LRIGs are.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.060
Mayu?

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.220
Uncertain.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.360
I don't know if that's her real name.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:28.950
But her emotions are what created 
the Selector battles.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.120
The girls who met LRIGs became Selectors

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.080
and battled to make their wishes come true.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:43.040
Several of them won and received the 
right to have their wishes granted.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.960
They became "Eternal Girls."

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.120
Many girls dreamed of their wishes coming true

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.010
and were turned into LRIGs.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.260
I am one of them.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.820
I wanted to save my friend.

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.820
I kept battling to have my wish granted.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:15.280
I won and won and...

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.020
I became an Eternal Girl.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.380
I became an LRIG.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.800
But I was fine with that.

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:34.410
As long as my friend was okay, 
as long as she'd open her eyes again...

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.310
I didn't care what happened to me.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.100
But...

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.100
Rest in peace, okay?

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:50.030
I swore revenge.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.100
I had to fight.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.930
I had to turn a Selector into an Eternal Girl 
and return to my world.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.940
If I fought someone, I crushed 
them without mercy.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.160
If my Selector lost, I would abandon them

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.020
and move on to the next.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.670
To me, Selectors were just tools.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.380
Useless.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.970
Many Selector wishes,

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.810
and many Selectors,

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.860
perished at my hands.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.290
Inexplicable.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.440
The reason is unknown,

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.170
but those Selector battles suddenly 
stopped without warning.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.500
Stopped?

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.570
Of course, they didn't completely end.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:37.660
After some time, a new Selector battle began.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.620
And many, including us, were caught up in it.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.680
Narumi-san's sister was one of them, right?

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.040
Point of interest.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.680
The rules and system of

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:55.180
the new Selector battles differ 
from the old ones in several ways.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.390
The time limit of ninety days.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.590
The fact that Selector memories become

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.130
coins they bet in battles.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.400
You're right.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.790
But the reason is unknown.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.860
So in the end, the true nature 
of the darkness is a mystery?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:12.610
That's right.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:17.350
But I have no intention of stopping.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.250
Hanna-chan...

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.420
The battles ended, and my daily life resumed.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:33.960
But the lost feelings of all those 
girls would never return.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:38.300
Instead of disappearing, their feelings 
took on a will of their own,

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.760
and a new game began.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.200
There is no exit in the Selector Battles.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.810
Only an unending chain of hatred and pain.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.520
The man named Satomi knows this.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.780
He enjoys controlling the hearts of others.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.530
Are you going to be his slave?

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:58.870
I know you really—

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.370
Shut up.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.360
It doesn't matter how the game started.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.540
It doesn't matter what anyone else thinks.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.750
I'm fighting the battles for myself!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.970
Remove all SIGNI.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.090
Turn end.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.390
What are you thinking?

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.420
It's your turn.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.900
Meru, attack!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:40.740
Why?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.280
Why did you deliberately lose?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.160
I still have something I need to do.

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.500
I can't leave the battles now.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.760
What's your reason for fighting?

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.070
Hello?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.460
It's me, Satomi!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:19.560
Thanks for the contract.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.620
So, I have a battle for you.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.970
I'll send you a text with the time and place.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:30.470
Oh, I'm sure you know this, 
but you can't refuse.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.630
Shou-chan, are you sure?

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.050
I'm going to bring back Morikawa.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.170
<b>Incoming Call 

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.050
<b>Call Ended</b>

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.630
Now to send that to Shirai-kun...

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.470
Oh?

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.420
You're already done?

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.880
I was interrupted.

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:49.810
Interrupted?

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.650
Well, it happens!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:58.860
I want to ask you something.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.100
What?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.320
Do you know about the first Selector battles?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.370
Oh...

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:07.180
The rumor that the despair of 
girls who lost their dreams

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.370
causes the battles to continue?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.960
It's such an appealing story, isn't it?

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:14.380
Despair creates despair,

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.420
and soon, despair is everywhere.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.010
And it all squelches together 
into one ugly mess,

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.130
and swallows up this garbage town!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:28.550
The trash gets kicked down, and then 
climbs back out of the dump.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:32.180
And only the truly strong can survive.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.310
You want to be strong, don't you, Chinatsu-chan?

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.880
I'll become strong!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.610
Stronger than anyone, right?

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.450
One more...

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.740
Coin bet!

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:00.930
Escape.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.090
A-Attack!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.140
It's our turn, Shou-chan!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.600
Donor, grow!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.890
Attack with Karaten and Nurari!

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:34.040
Just what are the Selector battles?

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:37.870
Did you know about the last 
Selector battles, Riru?

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:44.420
All I know is that I fight battles 
with the Selectors.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:45.820
I see.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.340
What are you thinking of?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.970
If I fight and take back all my memories...

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:55.600
Is that really the end of everything?

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.480
Chi-chan?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.060
What?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.690
You're not going to ask anything?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:05.770
I'm not going to stop being a Selector.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.420
That's not an answer.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.220
Don't worry.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.540
We're together. Always.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.460
I'll end with an attack.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.080
Guard.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.420
Advice.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.330
With those cards in your hand, 
you could take the attack

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.210
and build your Ener.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.600
Oh, right!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.390
<b>Satomi Kou 
It's time 

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.390
Parting.

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:35.900
I'm sorry it's so sudden, Suzuko-san,

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.530
but my battle class is over.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.230
Huh?

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:43.470
I got a message that a battle is ready for me.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.330
I'm about to win one final battle,

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.920
and end my time as a Selector.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:55.620
I guarantee that your skill is 
every bit as strong as mine now.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.660
Goodbye.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.250
Hanna-chan!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:14:59.960
Um...

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.080
Can I go with you?

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:06.880
I want to see your last battle.

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:22.190
I fought a battle yesterday.

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.880
I won, but I felt awful.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.200
There's something wrong with these battles!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.420
I don't want you to—

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.310
Give it up!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.790
You're in my way.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:39.750
What, two of you?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.330
Which am I fighting?

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.240
Um...

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:44.360
Me.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.720
She's a friend.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:47.880
Hanna-chan...

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.590
I don't care which of you it is.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.140
Open!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.360
Hanna-chan...

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.950
<b>Morikawa Chinatsu</b>

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.980
Chinatsu-chan, is something wrong?

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:18.160
I'm not feeling well.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.770
Roger that. Take care.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.370
<b>Morikawa Chinatsu</b>

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.600
That's a little strange.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:27.360
Think she's uncertain?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.340
She's spent too much time around 
your poisonous aura.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.150
That's bad.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.840
I need her to grow up just a bit more.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:38.470
Why not have that cute boy help?

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:40.910
Carnival,

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.730
you really are a wonderful lady!

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.400
My reason for fighting...

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.840
Chi-chan...

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.350
Chi-chan!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.460
Oh, it's been a while.

00:16:58.970 --> 00:16:59.910
You...

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:04.080
You're that Selector.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.870
No, I'm her LRIG.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.460
She disappeared.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.410
I ended up with control of her body,

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.320
and I tried living as a human.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:20.330
I lived in her home, walked 
the streets of her town...

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.980
I just woke up, ate, used 
the bathroom, and slept.

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:25.980
And then I did it all again.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.140
No stimulation at all.

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:31.200
Just an eternity of dead days.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:32.650
What are you sayi—

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:36.400
Living is an act filled with boredom and pain.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.280
I'm done.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.370
Goodbye.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.560
What happened?

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:53.920
Did someone jump down?

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.760
There is no exit in the Selector battles.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:03.560
Only an unending chain of hatred and pain.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.050
Coin bet!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.560
Blind.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:08.850
Again...

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.980
Damn it! Attack! Attack! Attack!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.390
Turn end!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.090
Oh, my, too bad.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.880
She missed.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.960
Now it's our turn, Hanna-sama.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.160
Roger.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.490
Summon Oigona, Influ, Parainflu.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.670
Activate effects!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.170
Check.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.170
One more attack, and you win.

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:34.760
Hanna-chan...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.270
Hanna wins.

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:39.110
Come, Hanna-sama, your orders.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:41.200
ARTS, Never End.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.700
Congratulations!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.950
The days I spent battling with you 
were very fun, Hanna-sama.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.680
Anonymous-chan...

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.750
This is goodbye, Hanna-sama.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:11.040
I will return the memories I've borrowed.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.270
Do you have a wish?

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:14.090
Hope.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.880
I desire the memories of the 
day my brother died.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.670
Understood.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:19.710
Then...

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:39.290
Yuuto, let's play hide-and-seek over there!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.290
Okay.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.800
Wait, Yuuto!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.610
Hanna-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.850
Ready?

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:52.460
Not yet!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:55.180
Ready?

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.740
Ready?

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:05.580
Ready?

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.240
Ready?

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.160
Yuuto, where are you?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.420
Yuuto?

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.480
I give up!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:17.190
Come out!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.150
Let's go home! Yuuto!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.390
Yuuto?

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.420
Did he go home?

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.240
Hurry, hurry!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.170
Wait!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.790
No!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.680
Hanna!

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.640
Yuuto is...

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.590
Yuuto...

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:58.760
No...

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.400
I...

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.980
It's... my fault?

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:08.780
I've waited so long for this day.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.730
I couldn't wait to see the look on your face

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.620
when you remembered everything!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.330
Your face, twisted with despair...

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.040
It's wonderful.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.500
Farewell, Hanna-sama.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.860
Hanna-chan?

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.140
Hanna-chan?

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.110
I...

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.860
I...

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:28.740
Let's have a battle, right now.

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:29.650
Let's have fun, boy.

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:31.630
I couldn't do anything.

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:31.920
This will be the last.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.900
What do I do?

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.640
I didn't think the battles were...

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.970
Okay, let's get started.

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:37.020
I'll stop it.

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:40.660
Next time: Devouring Prey / Tragedy and Comedy.

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.980
